        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi náunulwa ni Roho na achiniphirika hadi ryango wa mlairo wa dzuwa wa nyumba ya Mwenyezi Mlungu. Nálola pho phatu pha kumenyera, nami nchiona atu mirongo miiri na atsano. Kahi yao kala phana vilongozi airi a atu, yani Jaazania mwana wa Azuri na Pelatia mwana wa Benaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi Mlungu achiniamba, “Mwanadamu, aha ndio atu apangao mai na anaoapha atu a mudzi uhu ushauri mui. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha anaamba, ‘Wakati wa kudzenga nyumba tauphephi. Mudzi uhu ni dza nyungu ya kujitira, naswi hu dza nyama ndaniye.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa hivyo lavya unabii, we mwanadamu, tabiri chinyume chao.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi Roho wa Mwenyezi Mlungu wanedzera, naye achiniamba, “Amba, Mwenyezi Mlungu anaamba hivi: Mwi atu a Iziraeli, ninamanya mgombago kpwa mana namanya gosi garigo mwenu achilini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwimwi mwaolaga atu anji kahi ya uhu mudzi, na barabaraze mchiziodzaza nyufu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa hivyo Mwenyezi Mlungu anaamba: Zo nyufu mrizozibwaga mo kahi ya mudzi, ndizo nyama na mudzi uhu ndio yo nyungu, ela mwimwi, nindakutuluzani mo mudzini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munaogopha upanga ela Mwenyezi Mlungu anaamba ndareha upanga chinyume chenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tsona ndakutuluzani kondze ya nyo mudzi, nikutiyeni mikononi mwa ajeni nami nikuhukumuni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mundaolagbwa na upanga, nindakuamulani kahi za tsi yenu, Iziraeli. Namwi mundamanya kukala mimi, ndimi Mwenyezi Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mudzi uhu taundakala nyungu kpwenu wala mwimwi tamundakala nyama ndaniye. Mimi nindakuamulani hadi miphakani mwa Iziraeli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "namwi mundamanya kukala mimi, ndimi Mwenyezi Mlungu. Kpwa kukala tamlungire malagizo gangu wala kugbwira shariya zangu ela mwaiga mambo ga mataifa ganjina ganagokuzungulukani.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakati natabiri, Pelatia mwana wa Benaya achifwa. Ndipho nchidzibwaga chimabumabu na nchirira kpwa sauti nchiamba, “Aa Mwenyezi Mlungu, nyo Aiziraeli ariosala undaolaga tsetsetse?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi Mlungu achinijibu achiniamba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mwanadamu, nduguzo yani abario, na atu osi a Iziraeli ndio arioambwa ni atu a Jerusalemu, ‘Aho a kure na Mwenyezi Mlungu; tsi ihi hwaihewa ikale yehu.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kpwa hivyo amba, ‘Mwenyezi Mlungu anaamba: Dzagbwe náausa nchiaphirika kure kahi za mataifa, na kuatsamula kahi ya tsi nyinji, ela nkakala phatu phao phatakatifu kpwa muda mfupi kahi ya tsi chizophiya.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa hivyo amba, ‘Mwenyezi Mlungu anaamba: Nindakukusanyani kula kpwenye mataifa na tsi ambako kala mkatsamulwa, na nkuuyizireni tsi ya Iziraeli.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao ndiphouya, andausa vitu vyosi vya kutsukiza ninavyovimena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.36.26+EZK.36.27+EZK.36.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezekieli 36:26–28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nindaahenda akale na moyo wa msimamo na roho nyiphya, nindaausira moyo mufu na niaphe moyo wa kutii, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ili alunge malagizo gangu na kugbwira shariya zangu kpwa makini. Achihenda hivyo andakala atu angu nami ndakala Mlungu wao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela nyo ambao mioyo yao indakala inahamirwa ni vyo vitu vya kutsukiza, Mwenyezi Mlungu anaamba, nindaariphiza kpwa kuahika lawama ra mahendo gao.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
